:"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T12:03:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T12:07:08Z","body":"It would be helpful to get a crash dump with debug symbols as asked previously. There's not much to build upon in this issue to know what the problem would be. My guess would be that it's GPU driver related. So it would be helpful to know what GPU drivers are used (this should be printed by Godot when starting in a terminal).\n\nDo you reproduce the issue in earlier versions than 4.6? In general getting an overview of which Godot versions work or don't would help identify whether the crash was induced by changes to Godot or if it just never worked on your system.\n\nYou can also test Vulkan (Forward+/Mobile) vs OpenGL (Compatibility) if the problem is driver related, Compatibility might work.\n\nDeprioritizing as 4.7 release blocker as (so far) it doesn't appear to be a regression nor to affect a lot of users.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4602193500/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]